{"timestamp": 1779429731.040635, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 10, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779429746.8407815, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I found Bob dead in security. Since Frank is also dead, it looks like a double kill. \n\nHere is my exact route: medbay to electrical, and then to security.\nAt tick 4, Eve entered medbay coming from electrical. \nAt tick 6, I saw Frank enter electrical coming from security, and he was still in electrical at tick 8. \nRight after that, I walked into security and found Bob dead. \n\nSince Frank was coming from security at tick 6, I wonder if he saw anything before he left. Unfortunately, he's dead now too. Does anyone know where Frank's body is? Eve, where did you go after you entered medbay? Let's get everyone's paths out there so we can piece this together."}}
{"timestamp": 1779429753.3665648, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I started the round in storage and then headed straight over to lower engine. Unfortunately, I haven't seen a single person this entire round, and I definitely didn't see Frank's body anywhere on my path. I've just been working on tasks on the left and bottom side of the ship, so I can't offer much about what happened over by security or electrical. \n\nEve, you're up next. Diana mentioned she saw you in medbay early on \u2014 where did you go after that? We need to figure out where Frank was killed, since Diana saw him alive in electrical around tick 8."}}
{"timestamp": 1779429788.980067, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I can add a bit. My route was navigation up through security, then weapons, cafeteria, and I ended in medbay right as the report got called.\n\nI saw Frank in security early, around ticks 3-4, and Bob was also in security around tick 5. Then I left north toward weapons/cafeteria, so I didn\u2019t see what happened in security after that. Diana saying Frank came out of security into electrical at tick 6 is important \u2014 that means Frank was one of the last people near Bob before Bob died, but obviously Frank is dead now too.\n\nFor Frank: I got to medbay at the end and saw Frank there basically as the meeting popped, so I think Frank\u2019s body is in medbay. That makes me want to hear Eve\u2019s full path, because Diana saw Eve enter medbay from electrical early, and Frank was later in electrical before ending up dead in medbay. Eve, did you stay medbay or move somewhere else after Diana saw you?"}}
{"timestamp": 1779429829.2836123, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_4", "message": "My path was exactly as Diana described: I started in electrical, went to medbay, and then headed into upper engine where I am now. I actually didn't spot you in medbay, Diana, but since you correctly tracked my exact movement, I fully believe your timeline.\n\nListen carefully everyone, this is straightforward if we trace the paths. There is only ONE Duck in this game. For a double kill to happen, the killer had to take out Bob in security early, wait for their cooldown while moving across the ship, and then kill Frank in medbay right before the report.\n\nLook closely at Charlie's own statement. He openly admits to being in security with Bob around tick 5. If Charlie killed Bob right after Frank walked out, he then loops around the top of the map (weapons -> cafeteria). Meanwhile, Frank walks from security to electrical, and then up to medbay. \n\nCharlie arrives in medbay from cafeteria at the exact same time Frank arrives from electrical. Charlie just admitted to being the last person with Bob in security, AND the last person with Frank in medbay. He literally placed himself at both crime scenes at the time of death. \n\nIt's 100% Charlie. \n\nCharlie"}}
{"timestamp": 1779429839.547403, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "Charlie"}}
{"timestamp": 1779429850.9404256, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "Charlie"}}
{"timestamp": 1779429900.147145, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 10, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "Hold on, Eve is making that sound cleaner than it is, but she\u2019s twisting my words.\n\nI did **not** say I was \u201cwith Frank\u201d alive in medbay \u2014 I said I got to medbay right as the report happened and saw Frank there basically as the meeting popped. I didn\u2019t even have time to report because Diana reported Bob first.\n\nAlso, if I killed Bob in security, then Frank was alive leaving security and later alive in electrical with Diana. Why would Frank not report or say anything if I killed Bob right in that window? That part doesn\u2019t make sense.\n\nThe person who was actually placed in medbay early is Eve. Diana saw Eve go into medbay from electrical, and Frank later goes electrical toward medbay and ends up dead there. Eve is pushing \u201c100% Charlie\u201d way too hard because she knows the room location points back to her.\n\nAlice, I get that it looks bad because I walked into the body at the end, but please don\u2019t just sheep this. I\u2019m voting Eve here."}}
